('alict_01551', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'What is the output given by the below Karnaugh map?', '["A\u0305BC\u0305+AB+AC\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305", "AB + CB + AC", "B\u0305 C\u0305 + A\u0305 B", "A\u0305B + BC +A\u0305C", "ABC\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305+AB+B\u0305 C 6"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "A̅BC̅+AB+AC̅̅̅̅". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1551, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
