('alict_01562', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'If a Half Adder is used to add two 1 -bit numbers in a sequential what is the role of the carry output?', '["It is ignored in the next operation", "It is used as the input to the sum of the next addition. th", "It is directly fed into the next carry input. th", "It is stored in a register for future use. th", "It added to the output of the Half Adder. th"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "It is directly fed into the next carry input. th". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1562, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01563', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', '(P NOR Q) NOR (R NAND P) OR (P AND Q) If P = True , Q = True , R = False then the corresponding answer P = Q = R = False', '["1", "P.Q.R", "True", "False", "P"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "True". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1563, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
