('alict_01614', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which is not a category of considering according to the size?', '["Super computers iqmsrs", "Analog computers", "Mainframe computers uyd", "Mini computers", "Micro computers"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Option 1: Incorrect. This is a valid category based on size. These are the most powerful and largest computers. Option 2: Correct. This category is not based on size but on data processing type. Option 3: Incorrect. This is a valid category based on size', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1614, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
