('alict_01631', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which answer is not equal to the answer of 12516 + 458?', '["A\u2081\u2086", "512\u2088", "101001010\u2082", "330\u2081\u2080", "331\u2081\u2080"]'::jsonb, 5, 'The most convenient base to convert to for all bases is the base of two. let''s convert these two numbers to the base of two and add them', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1631, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01632', 12, 'General ICT', 'Amara is building a smart home lighting system. The lights in the hallway should turn ON when either of the following iqyqre ksjdi tlla myka The main door is opened', '["D + M + L", "D + M. L", "D. M + L", "D. M. L", "D. (M + L)"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Option 1: This turns the light ON if any one of the three is 1. Even if it''s not dark and there''s no the light could turn ON just because one condition is true (like jqjo" fldkafoaishla Option 2: Correct', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1632, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
