('alict_01686', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is the simplest form of (X + Y)(X + Z)? (X + Y)(X + Z) o@ Answer : 2) Explanation', '["X", "X+Y.Z", "X.(Y+Z)", "X+Y+Z", "X.Y.Z"]'::jsonb, 2, '= D(C̅B̅̅̅̅ + CC̅̅̅̅) + DC̅̅̅̅ = D(C̅B̅̅̅̅ + CC̅̅̅̅) + D̅ + C̅ De Morgan''s law = D(C̅̅ + B̅ + CC̅̅̅̅) + D̅ + C̅ De Morgan''s law = D(C + B̅ + CC̅̅̅̅) + D̅ + C̅ Double inverse law = D(C + B̅ + C̅ + C̅) + D̅ + C̅ De Morgan''s law = D(B̅ + C̅ + 1) + D̅ + C̅ Complement law = D1 + D̅ + C̅ Identity law', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1686, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
