('alict_01744', 12, 'General ICT', 'Considering series and parallel which is not a characteristic of parallel ports?', '["Transmits multiple bits at once. lsysmhla", "More wire is required", "is slow", "A DB-25 connector is used. DB-25", "More prone to errors due to timing issues. .Kkfha"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "is slow".', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1744, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01745', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following statements is TRUE about this code?', '["The function returns the largest even number in the list", "The function returns the sum of all odd numbers in the list", "The function returns the largest odd number in the list", "The function returns the index of the largest odd number", "The function will cause an error because max_val is initialized incorrectly. max_val"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "The function returns the largest odd number in the list".', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1745, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01746', 12, 'General ICT', 'What will the out be?', '["B\u0305", "B\u0305 + A + C\u0305", "B\u0305 + A\u0305 + C\u0305", "A\u0305 + CD\u0305", "BD + ABC"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "B̅".', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1746, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01747', 12, 'General ICT', 'Who presented the stored program concept ?', '["John Eckert", "Blaise Pascal", "Ada Lovelace", "John V on Neuman", "Charles Babbage"]'::jsonb, 4, 'John Eckert Co-inventor of the one of the earliest general -purpose electronic digital but not directly associated with the stored-program concept', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1747, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01748', 12, 'General ICT', 'What will the out be?', '["abc]", "(''ict'', ''from'', ''abc'')", "[''ict'', ''from'', ''abc'']", "[''from'', ''abc'']", "''abc'']"]'::jsonb, 3, 'substitute the values for x and use the insert() method at the specified position. x = [''ict'', ''abc''] x.insert(1, ''from'') The insert(1, ''from'') method inserts at index 1 in the list x. Now the list looks x = [''ict'', ''from'', ''abc'']', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1748, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01749', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following statements is true about compilers?', '["Converts the entire program into machine code before execution", "Converts the program to machine code line by line. jevigyk", "Converts the program into bytecode for execution", "Provide immediate feedback on syntax errors. LKav", "Interprets the program directly without generating an intermediate representation"]'::jsonb, 1, 'wehs wfkla fkdjkafka ukaoehs fukak( Statement A compiler translates the entire source code of a program into machine code (or an intermediate such as assembly language) before execution begins', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1749, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
