('alict_01808', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is the primary purpose of a domain name in web hosting?', '["To improve website performance", "To serve as a unique address for accessing a website", "To enhance website security", "To increase website traffic", "To store website files"]'::jsonb, 2, 'A domain name serves as a user unique identifier for accessing a website. It maps to the IP address of the web server hosting the allowing users to easily find and access websites without needing to remember numerical IP addresses. th bv', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1808, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
