('alict_01818', 12, 'General ICT', 'What will the following code print?', '["[0, 2, 2, 6, 4]", "[0, 1, 4, 3, 8]", "[0, 2, 2, 3, 8]", "[0, 1, 2, 3, 4]", "[1, 2, 2, 4, 8]"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The code processes a list of numbers using the map function combined with a lambda function. 1. Input List nums = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4] 2. Lambda Function lambda x * 2 if x % 2 == 0 else x • For each number x in • If x % 2 == 0 (i.e., x is even), return x * 2 • return x (unchanged) 3', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1818, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
