('alict_01848', 12, 'General ICT', 'What does the line-height property specify?', '["The spacing between words within the paragraph. f\u00feoh", "The spacing between the lines of text within the paragraph. f\u00feoh", "The size of the font used for the paragraph. f\u00feoh", "The alignment of the paragraph within its containing element. f\u00feoh tys wvx.=", "The spacing between characters within the paragraph f\u00feoh"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Statement This refers to word which is adjusted using the word-spacing not the line-height property. jpk ilia Statement The line-height property specifies the spacing between the lines of text within a paragraph', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', NULL, 1848, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
